- A Paygent account — sign up at [paygent.to](https://paygent.to) to get your `pg_live_...` API key

```
from paygent import Paygent
pg = Paygent.init(api_key="pg_live_...")
```
`Paygent.init()` connects to the backend, patches the OpenAI and Anthropic SDKs so every LLM call is intercepted, and starts the background sync thread for usage events. Call it once per process, ideally at app startup.
```
import OpenAI from "openai";
import { Paygent } from "@paygentjs/sdk";
const pg = await Paygent.init({ apiKey: "pg_live_..." });
const openai = pg.instrument(new OpenAI());
```

